        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>小学毕业升学必刷试卷(九)</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        padding: 30px;\n        max-width: 850px;\n        color: #000;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n    h1 {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 28px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n    .header-info {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: flex-end;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    table.score-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    table.score-table th, table.score-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #000;\n        padding: 8px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n        font-size: 16px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .q-row {\n        display: flex;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .q-num {\n        width: 25px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .q-content {\n        flex-grow: 1;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        border: 1px dashed #999;\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        text-align: center;\n        color: #666;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        padding: 10px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .figures-container {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-around;\n        margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .figure-item {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .figure-caption {\n        margin-top: 5px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .report-table {\n        width: calc(100% - 25px);\n        margin-left: 25px;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .report-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #000;\n        padding: 8px 10px;\n        font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .footer {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-top: 40px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    u {\n        text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>小学毕业升学必刷试卷(九)</h1>\n\n<div class=\"header-info\">\n    <div>测试时间:90 分钟</div>\n    <div>满分:100 分</div>\n</div>\n\n<table class=\"score-table\">\n    <tr>\n        <td style=\"width: 12%;\">题&nbsp;&nbsp;号</td>\n        <td style=\"width: 11%;\">一</td>\n        <td style=\"width: 11%;\">二</td>\n        <td style=\"width: 11%;\">三</td>\n        <td style=\"width: 11%;\">四</td>\n        <td style=\"width: 11%;\">五</td>\n        <td style=\"width: 11%;\">六</td>\n        <td style=\"width: 22%;\">总&nbsp;&nbsp;分</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>得&nbsp;&nbsp;分</td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td></td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">一、填空题。 (每空 1 分,共 19 分)</div>\n\n<div class=\"q-row\">\n    <div class=\"q-num\">1.</div>\n    <div class=\"q-content\">\n        地球上每年都有<u>15000400</u> 公顷的森林被毁掉,横线上的数读作(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)<br>\n        公顷,改写成用“万”作单位的数是(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)公顷,用“四舍五入”法省略万位后<br>\n        面的尾数约是(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)公顷。\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"q-row\">\n    <div class=\"q-num\">2.</div>\n    <div class=\"q-content\">\n        某石拱桥警戒水位是 5 m,把超过 5 m 的部分用正数表示,把低于 5 m 的部分用负数<br>\n        表示。一场暴雨后,水位上升到 6.2 m,应记作(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)m;第二天,水位下降到 4 m,<br>\n        就记作(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)m。\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"q-row\">\n    <div class=\"q-num\">3.</div>\n    <div class=\"q-content\">\n        $2\\frac{2}{7}$ 的分数单位是(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;),它有(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)个这样的分数单位,它的倒数是(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)。\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"q-row\">\n    <div class=\"q-num\">4.</div>\n    <div class=\"q-content\">\n        $a \\div b = 3(a,b$都是不为$0$的自然数$)$,则$a$和$b$的最大公因数是(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;),最小公倍数<br>\n        是(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)。\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"q-row\">\n    <div class=\"q-num\">5.</div>\n    <div class=\"q-content\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;\">\n        <div>\n            右面是一个长方体纸盒的展开图,这个纸盒的表面积是<br>\n            (&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)cm²,体积是(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)cm³。\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 100px; margin-left: 15px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n            [Diagram: Net of a rectangular prism with dimensions 4, 3, 6 (单位:cm)]\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"q-row\">\n    <div class=\"q-num\">6.</div>\n    <div class=\"q-content\">\n        一个直角梯形高 8 cm,如果把它的下底缩短成一个点,就得到一个等腰直角三角形,<br>\n        面积变成了原来梯形的 $\\frac{1}{4}$,原来梯形的面积是(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)cm²。\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"q-row\">\n    <div class=\"q-num\">7.</div>\n    <div class=\"q-content\">\n        如图,独轮车的轮子在向前滚动时,$e$ 点正好和 1 重合,$f$ 点正好和 2 重合.以此类推,<br>\n        当轮子滚动一周时,$e$ 点和(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)重合。\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"figures-container\">\n    <div class=\"figure-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 110px;\">\n            [Diagram: Wheel with points a-h on a number line 1-12]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"figure-caption\">第 7 题图</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"figure-item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 110px;\">\n            [Diagram: Circle cut into sectors and rearranged into a trapezoid]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"figure-caption\">第 8 题图</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"q-row\">\n    <div class=\"q-num\">8.</div>\n    <div class=\"q-content\">\n        如图,把一个圆剪拼成一个近似的梯形,这个梯形的周长大约是 28.56 厘米,则这个<br>\n        圆的面积大约是(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)平方厘米。\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"q-row\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n    <div class=\"q-num\">9.</div>\n    <div class=\"q-content\">实验报告。</div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"report-table\">\n    <tr>\n        <td>内容:测量家中一个没拧紧的水龙头的滴水情况。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>做法:把一个底面直径为 6 厘米的空圆柱形玻璃杯放在水龙头下面接水。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>测量:1 分滴水 40 次,5 分钟玻璃杯内水面的高度为 2 厘米。</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"footer\">— 33 —</div>\n\n</body>\n</html></body>\n</html>"
